# Every chunk_id in this project is sha256 over normalized file content. The
# normalizer folds CRLF -> LF, but the golden set, the fixtures and the eval
# outputs are compared byte-for-byte across machines, and git is not a neutral
# party: core.autocrlf is `true` on the Windows install used for editing and
# unset on the Ubuntu/WSL side and in CI. That difference alone rewrites line
# endings on checkout, which shifts fixture bytes, which shifts chunk_ids, and
# an eval that passed on the laptop fails in CI for no reason a diff can show.
#
# So: disable all text conversion, everywhere, unconditionally. Bytes in the
# object store are the bytes on disk on every machine.
* -text

# Committed frozen artifacts are binary regardless of platform.
*.npz binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
